      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Club Rogue was one of them. Basically the music doesn't play there. But once someone with the Beta client joined the music started for everyone and was blasting. wrld_e016cb6e-45ec-4c52-bf63-8db2c1d90172\n\nAnother world was mine but I reuploaded it at 0.1 but you guys removed the open beta so I can't test if it still happens. On live client it's super quiet now. wrld_6fa3969d-9425-4630-b51d-d9f66cbb71bf\n\nOthers noticed the music being extremely loud too at the time. Yet no complaints on Live client. It may be possible it's due to these worlds being on an older SDK. The music for mine is streamed in using youtube. Club Rogue I believe uses the web panel features you disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
